    "markdown": "# Brizza Aesthetics\n**Manhattan, New York**\n\n> Sample for a fictional learning project, not legal advice; a licensed attorney and medical director must review before real use.\n\n# Financial and Cancellation Policy Acknowledgment\n\n\n## Patient information\n\n| Field | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Patient name | ________________________________ |\n| Date of birth | ______________ |\n| Chart ID (Patient ID, for example BRZ0001) | ______________ |\n\n\n## What this form is\n\nThis form is your acknowledgment of Brizza Aesthetics' late-cancel and no-show fees, and related financial terms that are already set in the clinic's operating SOPs. It is a required intake acknowledgment. It is **not** treatment consent, clinical photography consent, or a marketing authorization.\n\nService list prices are not printed on this form because they have not been set in the sourced materials.\n\n[PLACEHOLDER — set by Nicole: service list prices, unit or syringe prices, peel, facial, and enhancement prices.]\n\n\n## Appointments, reminders, and notice\n\nThe clinic sends appointment reminders 48 hours and 24 hours before a scheduled visit (SMS is the primary method, with your communication preferences respected). Reminders are a courtesy. You are responsible for knowing your appointment date and time, and for giving notice if you need to cancel or reschedule.\n\nTo cancel or reschedule without a late-cancel fee, you must give at least **24 hours'** notice before the appointment start time. Notice time is based on the clinic's timestamps. Cancellations made with at least 24 hours' notice are not charged the late-cancel fee.\n\n\n## Late-cancel fee\n\nIf you cancel or reschedule with **less than 24 hours'** notice, a **$50 late-cancel fee** applies.\n\n[confirm with Clinic Ops Lead: any exceptions to the $50 late-cancel fee. The SOPs state that exceptions are not yet sourced and must not be invented. No illness, weather, or other exception is listed in this form until Clinic Ops confirms it.]\n\n## No-show fee\n\nIf you miss an appointment and do not cancel in advance (a no-show), a **$50 no-show fee** applies.\n\nThe no-show fee may be waived only by the **Clinic Manager** or the **Owner**. Other staff, including the Coordinator, Medical Assistant, NP Injector, and Aesthetician, may not waive this fee on their own.\n\n## How these fees relate to treatment and payment\n\nThese fees are separate from charges for services you actually receive. Completing a service and collecting payment are tracked separately in the clinic's process. This acknowledgment does not set service prices, membership or package terms, tax, or refund rules for completed services.\n\n[confirm with Clinic Ops Lead: how the $50 fee is collected (for example, at the next visit or by another approved method). Sources describe payment at checkout and payment profiles, but they do not state a card-on-file rule for these fees.]\n\n[confirm with Clinic Ops Lead and Finance: membership, package, and refund rules if those programs are offered. Finance models memberships and packages, but EMR enrollment remains flagged, and terms are not invented here.]\n\n## Clinic-initiated changes\n\nIf the clinic must cancel or reschedule your appointment, that is recorded as a clinic-initiated change. This form does not charge you a late-cancel or no-show fee for a clinic-initiated cancellation.\n\n## Questions\n\nI have had a chance to ask questions about the 24-hour notice rule, the $50 late-cancel fee, and the $50 no-show fee. My questions have been answered in a way I understand.\n\n## When you sign this form again\n\nYou will be asked to sign this form again at least once every 12 months, and whenever the service, product, or device changes.\n\n## Initials\n\nPlease initial each item to show that you have read and understood it.\n\n| Item | Initials |\n| --- | --- |\n| I understand I must give at least 24 hours' notice to cancel or reschedule without a late-cancel fee. | ________ |\n| I understand a $50 late-cancel fee applies if I cancel or reschedule with less than 24 hours' notice. | ________ |\n| I understand a $50 no-show fee applies if I miss an appointment, and that only the Clinic Manager or the Owner may waive that fee. | ________ |\n| I understand service prices are provided separately, and this form does not replace treatment consent. | ________ |\n| I understand I will be asked to sign this form again at least once every 12 months, and whenever the service, product, or device changes. | ________ |\n\n\nI have read this financial and cancellation policy. I understand it. I agree to the 24-hour notice rule and the $50 late-cancel and $50 no-show fees described above.\n\n## Signatures\n\n### Patient\n\nI have read this form, or it has been read to me. I understand it. I have had a chance to ask questions. My signature means I agree to what this form describes.\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Patient signature | ________________________________ |\n| Patient printed name | ________________________________ |\n| Date | ______________ |\n| Time | ______________ |\n\nIf a personal representative signs for the patient:\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Representative signature | ________________________________ |\n| Printed name and relationship | ________________________________ |\n| Date | ______________ |\n\n### Witness (Medical Assistant) — optional\n\nThe MA may present this form and witness the patient's signature only. The MA does not obtain informed consent and does not sign as provider.\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| MA witness signature | ________________________________ |\n| MA printed name | ________________________________ |\n| Date | ______________ |\n\n### Interpreter — complete only if used\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Language used | ________________________________ |\n| Interpreter name | ________________________________ |\n| Interpreter signature | ________________________________ |\n| Date | ______________ |\n\n\n### Staff who received this acknowledgment\n\nThis is not a treatment-consent signature and is not a provider informed-consent signature. The Clinic Coordinator typically collects this intake acknowledgment.\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Staff signature and role | ________________________________ |\n| Printed name | ________________________________ |\n| Date | ______________ |\n\n---\n\nForm draft for a fictional EMR mockup. Document category: Consent / Financial acknowledgment. Clinic document statuses, when used: Pending, Completed, Expired, or Superseded.\n"
